# 本目录直接文件说明

仅列出本目录文件；子目录内容请查看对应目录中的 `tree`。

- `.gitignore` — Generated Rust and Android build artifacts excluded from version control.
- `Cargo.lock` — Locked workspace dependency graph for reproducible Rust builds.
- `Cargo.toml` — Cargo workspace membership and shared package metadata.
- `README.md` — Project purpose, directory conventions, tree update commands, and local ledger UI run instructions.
- `tree` — 本目录直接文件的说明索引。
